From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <prskid1000@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 08:29:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: per-instance slot content in the scene graph and
 the .fig

A slot frame (telecode/slot) filled by an instance (telecode/slots
{filled}) keeps its own layers: instance sync and the .fig override
propagation leave it alone, the writer stores a filled slot's layers under
the instance with the schema's isSlotContent flag and the slot name, and
the reader attaches them to the slot clone after population (populating
the instance first when the lazy import skipped its page).
